      "summaryMarkdown": "PIN-1 met. `PinSource` has only `Project`/`Default` (`project`/`default`); `GpuxProfile`, `GPUX_CHECKOUT`, `Project::is_gpux_checkout` and the `gpux-checkout` fixture are gone, and no reference remains in `src/` or `tests/` outside the neutral `gpux-testkit` member names used as negative cases. `Pins::resolve` applies one rule (project key, else `DEFAULTS`; build tools `None` without a key; system image follows the platform pin and its source); module docs list two sources and the `DEFAULTS` comment names no library. The new `tests/pin_sources.rs` group covers a `gpux-testkit` workspace getting all defaults, declared Android pins as `project` regardless of member names (cargo and files-only discovery), the exhaustive two-variant source, and doctor text/JSON showing only `project`/`default`. Rewritten `project_pins`, `doctor` and `setup_android` tests encode the generic rule. Stale project-domain memory (rules naming the gpux-checkout profile) is for post-epic memory sync per the declared supersession; README is DOC-2 (sprint 4).",
